{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_875.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"c31db5e26724ca3e09a7168cd9f3cd7d949f60b6d8323f481e2f58d439d22ce3","ja":"リスペクト律っちゃん","zh":"向律子致敬","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_875.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"1312f52a30ac3c8098ed14ac2ecfc626c50e3e54cc86e976fccc86201909d877","ja":"亜美、真美、国語ドリルはちゃんとやってきたで\nしょうね？　練習前に確認させてもらうわよ。","zh":"亚美、真美，语文练习册都认真做完了吧？练习前先让我检查一下。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_875.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"c31505107941a62192460dad4a60d7f9de78cd61c0b0b536bf2189414846fdcf","ja":"待った！　その前に聞いてよ！\n律っちゃんに捧ぐ、魂のラップ！　チェケラ！","zh":"等一下！在那之前先听我说！\n献给律子的灵魂说唱！来听听！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_875.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"5393fec1c545a1a91c81cb880b31bdd9fda05c525bb18ecfd6697c2674abd0cd","ja":"律っちゃんキビシー　けどいつも感謝してるしー\n愛あるからね　アメとムシだね♪","zh":"律子好严格——不过我一直都很感谢她——\n因为这是出于爱嘛，就是糖和虫♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_875.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"b86d3ba2f9b45c65d9c45902cf726747971a0c9d97b66585eafe5bf68d5e2563","ja":"思ってるよ　まるでリアル姉ちゃん\n家族トーゼン　まさにファミリーじゃん　Hey Yo!","zh":"我就是这么觉得的，简直就像亲姐姐一样  \n家人嘛，当然就是一家人啦，Hey Yo！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_875.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"cef5bb87e9e63c016aa184d48d04487080c750d8d7e02b20a78cc817f8540368","ja":"ちょ……ちょっと？\n急にどうしたのよ、ふたりとも？","zh":"等……等一下？\n你们两个突然这是怎么了？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_875.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"f2365bfe4c077ffc397166c9bc95ab33fcd31514eb2772902924189f42ef321c","ja":"んっふっふ～。亜美達、気づいちゃったんだ～？\nラップはディスだけじゃなくリスペクトも大事だって！","zh":"嘻嘻嘻～我们已经发现了哦～？说唱可不只是diss，尊重也很重要！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_875.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"f1294e100d85e4a1916354652eb7089e5cde698b63393b0465a07842c7f8b0e1","ja":"だからイチバン尊敬してる律っちゃんに、\n感謝の気持ちこめこめで歌ったっぽいYO！","zh":"所以，好像是怀着对最尊敬的律子姐满满的感谢之情唱的哟！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_875.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"2589e53e311f08651748aa9a86f9f9fb484c8a2e47b38de818031cdd5b307311","ja":"そ、そうなの……。なんだか照れるわね。\nでもありがとう。ふたりの考え、よ～くわかったわ。","zh":"是、是这样啊……总觉得有点害羞呢。\n不过还是谢谢你们。我已经非常清楚地明白你们两人的想法了。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_875.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"fecfaccb9f425363fd8dec72a318a7d21119dad37ceb3215db64173a6a7428a4","ja":"……要するに、宿題やってこなかったんでしょ？","zh":"……也就是说，你没做作业吧？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_875.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"35b4db3fab3e580bc679d637fa4afada663b86d2da5a641638536452de06fe2e","ja":"ギクッ！！","zh":"糟糕！！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_875.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"a20554a342e3f73665246ce8b3a695fe06b4ef60ba9544f11e49bef2f1dba09d","ja":"り、律っちゃん、なぜそれを……。\nもしやおぬし、エスパー……！？","zh":"律、律姐，你怎么会知道那个……。难道说，你是超能力者……！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_875.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"4ce836a8b066c78808360cd72c0ecef8267bec4a9f6117a14f187f640c5b19bc","ja":"あのね。「アメとムシ」じゃなくて「アメとムチ」。\n「家族トーゼン」じゃなくて「家族同然」！","zh":"那个啊，不是“糖果和虫子”，而是“糖果和鞭子”。\n不是“家族当然”，而是“如同家人”！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_875.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"9b064ebe68339f70e9a534637b301572cc39d39e5ea21ff7137ce68e52f5cbb1","ja":"こんな間違いをするのは、\nちゃんと勉強してこなかった何よりの証拠よ！","zh":"会犯下这样的错误，就是没有好好学习过的最好证明！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_875.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"6dc20f44f6eaf4cf14e7f96242c1dfb0a8bda3ca9482e186dca197bc912961a3","ja":"う、うあうあ～……！？　しまった～！","zh":"呜、呜哇呜哇～……！？糟了～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_875.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"47fef93ed7abd8cf7f62be3d8fdd7d67e0449f4581a85f51aa32509a5d91d44d","ja":"ふふん。どうせ私の気を逸らそうと\nしたんだろうけど……策士、策に溺れたわね。","zh":"哼哼。你是想转移我的注意力吧……没想到聪明反被聪明误。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_875.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"68130553326307c900ed80f327b4a6ba36de7183ec176253f2f9a9642bac8bec","ja":"さあ、ふたりとも観念しなさい。プチョヘンザ！","zh":"来吧，你们两个都认命吧。举起手来！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_875.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"0f598c8ad1d6d77d54abc0be5747dd506f8fb0a2734104e6fd2f8294e6add527","ja":"はぁ～……。\n律っちゃんにはかなわないよ～……！","zh":"唉～……  \n我可比不过律子……！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
